.subckt async_sar start comp_out_p comp_done vdd vss sample_en rst_latch done dout[7] dout[6] dout[5] dout[4] dout[3] dout[2] dout[1] dout[0] dac_in[7] dac_in[6] dac_in[5] dac_in[4] dac_in[3] dac_in[2] dac_in[1] dac_in[0]

* Row 0: Shift Register & Input Inverters
x_sr8 vdd vss vss comp_done_b rst_n_int Q0 Q1 Q2 Q3 Q4 Q5 Q6 Q7 open_done shift_reg_8bit

x_isrc vdd vss comp_done comp_done_b async_inverter
x_irst vdd vss start rst_n_int async_inverter
x_ise1 vdd vss start se_n async_inverter
x_ise2 vdd vss se_n sample_en async_inverter
x_ndn  vdd vss Q7 comp_done done_n_int async_nand2
x_idn  vdd vss done_n_int done async_inverter

* Row 1: 8x Bit Registers
* bit_reg: VDD VSS comp_out en rst_n bit_out
* bit 7 has en = Q0, bit 6 has en = Q1, ..., bit 0 has en = Q7
x_bit0 vdd vss comp_out_p Q7 rst_n_int dout[0] bit_reg
x_bit1 vdd vss comp_out_p Q6 rst_n_int dout[1] bit_reg
x_bit2 vdd vss comp_out_p Q5 rst_n_int dout[2] bit_reg
x_bit3 vdd vss comp_out_p Q4 rst_n_int dout[3] bit_reg
x_bit4 vdd vss comp_out_p Q3 rst_n_int dout[4] bit_reg
x_bit5 vdd vss comp_out_p Q2 rst_n_int dout[5] bit_reg
x_bit6 vdd vss comp_out_p Q1 rst_n_int dout[6] bit_reg
x_bit7 vdd vss comp_out_p Q0 rst_n_int dout[7] bit_reg

* Row 2: Handshake & Timing
x_icd   vdd vss comp_done comp_done_inv async_inverter
x_del   vdd vss comp_done comp_done_delayed_n async_delay_chain
x_stdel vdd vss start start_n async_start_delay
x_idnv  vdd vss done done_n async_inverter
x_nset  vdd vss comp_done_inv comp_done_delayed_n gate_settle async_nand2
x_nctl  vdd vss start_n done_n gate_ctrl async_nand2
x_nrst  vdd vss gate_settle gate_ctrl rst_latch async_nor2

* Row 3: First Stage DAC NORs (nor_dq)
* nor2: VDD VSS A B Y (A = dout[k], B = Q[7-k], Y = dac_n[k])
x_nor_dq0 vdd vss dout[0] Q7 dac_n[0] async_nor2
x_nor_dq1 vdd vss dout[1] Q6 dac_n[1] async_nor2
x_nor_dq2 vdd vss dout[2] Q5 dac_n[2] async_nor2
x_nor_dq3 vdd vss dout[3] Q4 dac_n[3] async_nor2
x_nor_dq4 vdd vss dout[4] Q3 dac_n[4] async_nor2
x_nor_dq5 vdd vss dout[5] Q2 dac_n[5] async_nor2
x_nor_dq6 vdd vss dout[6] Q1 dac_n[6] async_nor2
x_nor_dq7 vdd vss dout[7] Q0 dac_n[7] async_nor2

* Row 4: Second Stage DAC NORs (nor_st)
* nor2: VDD VSS A B Y (A = dac_n[k], B = start, Y = dac_in[k])
x_nor_st0 vdd vss dac_n[0] start dac_in[0] async_nor2
x_nor_st1 vdd vss dac_n[1] start dac_in[1] async_nor2
x_nor_st2 vdd vss dac_n[2] start dac_in[2] async_nor2
x_nor_st3 vdd vss dac_n[3] start dac_in[3] async_nor2
x_nor_st4 vdd vss dac_n[4] start dac_in[4] async_nor2
x_nor_st5 vdd vss dac_n[5] start dac_in[5] async_nor2
x_nor_st6 vdd vss dac_n[6] start dac_in[6] async_nor2
x_nor_st7 vdd vss dac_n[7] start dac_in[7] async_nor2

.ends
